1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
and a length of red rope.

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,900
He lines them up along the wall.

3
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,080
Don't talk to anyone.

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,360
Just look like you're waiting.

5
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,920
Then he turns to the doorman.

6
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,720
Whoever comes next, send them away.

7
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,020
The doorman looks through the window at the empty room.

8
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,580
We have 300 seats.

9
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,720
Why am I saying no?

10
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,800
A couple walks up in their best clothes.

11
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,320
The doorman folds his arms.

12
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,040
Not tonight.

